# =============================================================================

## VSCode
.vscode/
*.code-workspace

## JetBrains (AppCode)
.idea/
*.iml

## Vim
*.swp
*.swo
*~

## Emacs
*~
\#*\#
/.emacs.desktop
/.emacs.desktop.lock
*.elc

# =============================================================================
# Environment & Secrets
# =============================================================================

## Environment files (NEVER commit these)
.env
.env.*
*.env
.envrc

## API keys and secrets
secrets/
*.pem
*.p12
*.key
*.cer
!*.cer.example

## Provisioning profiles
*.mobileprovision
*.provisionprofile

## Keychain
*.keychain
*.keychain-db

# =============================================================================
# Build & Archives
# =============================================================================

## Distribution builds
dist/
*.dmg

## Archives
*.xcarchive
*.ipa
*.app.dSYM.zip

## Carthage
Carthage/Build/
Carthage/Checkouts/

## CocoaPods
Pods/
!Podfile
!Podfile.lock

## Fastlane
fastlane/report.xml
fastlane/Preview.html
fastlane/screenshots/**/*.png
fastlane/test_output

